103
00:05:38,690 --> 00:05:40,190
we're using the reduce method,

104
00:05:42,450 --> 00:05:47,283
but again, let's start with the easier solution here.

105
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:51,200
And so if we want to count the deposits

