00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:54,740
So that was one way of doing it.

125
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:56,200
Let's comment it out

126
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:57,980
because as I mentioned before,

127
00:06:57,980 --> 00:06:59,350
